Subject: [PATCH] feat(index): SQLite FTS5 IndexPort as candidate generator for
 lexical_v1 (C198)

FTS5 (BM25) only selects candidates; final scores are the reference
lexical_ranking, so results match InMemoryIndex (60 random queries, 300 docs;
50/50 top-5 on 20 000 docs, p50 19 ms vs 621 ms). Rebuild builds beside the
live index and swaps with os.replace + directory fsync; private 0600 file;
JSON values only. Passes IndexPortContract unchanged. Not wired.

